WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:25.244
Sign in as the cashier or owner and open Sales, then POS Terminal.

2
00:00:25.344 --> 00:00:31.424
Before selling you open a register. Enter the cash already in the drawer as the starting amount.

3
00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:36.064
Select Open Register. Everything you sell now belongs to this shift.

4
00:00:36.165 --> 00:00:41.488
Product tiles fill the left side. Each shows the price and how much stock is left.

5
00:00:41.592 --> 00:00:46.914
Category pills above the grid narrow the list to one aisle.

6
00:00:47.014 --> 00:00:52.214
Or type a product name or scan a barcode in the box at the top, then select Add.

7
00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:56.690
Select Add on a tile to put the product in the cart on the right.

8
00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:01.441
Add a couple more products. Each one appears as a line with its price.

9
00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:06.962
Use plus and minus on a cart line to change the quantity. The total updates at once.

10
00:01:09.475 --> 00:01:15.005
Leave the customer as Walk-in, or search for a regular so the sale is on their record.

11
00:01:15.105 --> 00:01:19.756
Pick the customer from the list. Their pricing and loyalty then apply.

12
00:01:19.856 --> 00:01:23.243
Select Pay Now to open the Take Payment window.

13
00:01:23.343 --> 00:01:26.675
Choose how the customer pays. Here it is Cash.

14
00:01:26.775 --> 00:01:31.645
Type the amount the customer hands over. Change Due is worked out for you.

15
00:01:34.003 --> 00:01:36.289
Select Pay & Complete Sale.

16
00:01:39.395 --> 00:01:44.869
The sale is recorded. You see the sale number, the amount paid and a receipt preview.

17
00:01:44.969 --> 00:01:50.774
Print the receipt if the customer wants one, or select New Sale to serve the next customer.

18
00:01:50.874 --> 00:01:53.764
That is a complete sale from the till.
